  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1503.01 License Required. No person shall engage in the business of employee leasing nor hold itself out to the public as an employee leasing company without first having secured a license under the provisions of RSA 277-B and these rules.\n\nSource. #6626, eff 11-4-97, EXPIRED: 11-4-05\n\nNew. #10221, eff 11-3-12, ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22",
